    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>TitTok 3: FINAL CHAPTER - the final part of the legendary TitTok saga. The darkest chapter of the trilogy..</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003220/extras/17d865f379c91afaa55adae2cceb2c36.poster.avif?t=1745382199\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003220/extras/17d865f379c91afaa55adae2cceb2c36.webm?t=1745382199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003220/extras/17d865f379c91afaa55adae2cceb2c36.mp4?t=1745382199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><i>The player's goal is to complete all levels and not die from the attacks of evil enemies and traps! You can find bombs on levels and plant them ANYWHERE, even in the air!</i><br><br>\u25aa Cute Kitties \uff3c(\u2267\u25bd\u2266)\uff0f <br>\u25aa Atmospheric and melodic soundtrack by <strong>Sun Candles</strong><br>\u25aa Three difficulty levels, from super-Easy to Hardcore!<br>\u2022 Mind-blowing gameplay unfolding in 40 unique locations.<br>\u25aa Cool puzzles! Three difficulty modes of 10 levels.<br>\u25aa Unlimited number of Bombs and Massive explosions<br>\u25aa Double jumps to the skies! Ultimate attacks!<br>\u25aa Deadly Lasers, Destructive Cannons and Fast Knives!<br>\u25aa Crazy moving platforms and dizzying slow-mo portals!<br>\u25aa Incredibly beautiful effects, cool lighting and fine particles!<br>\u25aa A variety of enemies, Mini-Bosses and a cool Super Boss.<br>\u25aa Bigger, Longer, Uncut and detailed levels.<br>\u25aa Super cool plot, an epic conclusion to the enchanting trilogy!<br>\u25aa 99 achievements and much more, incredible and exciting!<br>\u25aa And in the game you can and even need to MEOW a lot ^.^<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003220/extras/248d61064d99e2b3d6dd83ebbd7b8eeb.poster.avif?t=1745382199\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003220/extras/248d61064d99e2b3d6dd83ebbd7b8eeb.webm?t=1745382199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003220/extras/248d61064d99e2b3d6dd83ebbd7b8eeb.mp4?t=1745382199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>TikTok? No! TitTok! TikTok \u2260 TitTok</strong><br><strong>TitTok 3: FINAL CHAPTER - An epic conclusion to the enchanting trilogy!</strong><br><strong>And remember: &quot;Tit before your Tok!&quot;</strong>",
